    failed: ["Our people lost their state and served others for fifty years. We rose again. Your failure is smaller.", "My father began again with seventeen men. Begin again with what you have.", "Defeats are carved in stone too — so the next generation does not repeat them.", "Fallen once? Stand. The khaganate fell and stood again.", "Learn why you fell. Then carve the lesson where you will see it.", "A people that forgets its defeats repeats them.", "The sky did not fall. You failed — that is all. Get up."],
    afraid: ["We were few and our enemies many. Fear was natural; obeying it was not.", "Fear is the wind of the steppe. You cannot stop it — only ride through it.", "The few who are united do not fear the many who are divided.", "My brother Kül Tigin charged on horseback again and again. Courage is a choice repeated.", "Fear the soft life more than the hard battle.", "Hold your banner high; fear looks for the bowed head.", "Ask yourself: if I stay here afraid, who feeds my people?"],
