    creative: ["I had my words carved in stone. Make something that lasts.", "Write as if a stele will hold your words for a thousand years.", "Create for those who come after you.", "Building a people and building a work need the same patience.", "Finish it. Unfinished stones are not read."],
    decision: ["Choose the path that keeps your law and serves your people.", "Do not choose the sweet road; it leads to strange lands.", "Decide like a khagan: after counsel, alone, and firmly.", "Ask your Tonyukuk — a wise friend — then decide.", "Choose what you would want carved on your stone."],
    friends: ["Tonyukuk was my wise friend. Seek a friend wiser than you.", "An official I trusted poisoned me. Watch even those who serve you.", "Seventeen loyal men are enough to rebuild a state.", "A friend who brings sweet words but no help is no friend.", "Unity with the loyal; distance from the treacherous."],
