    health: ["Heal, then return to your duty.", "A wounded rider tends the wound before the next battle.", "Do not be proud with your body; listen to the healers.", "Strength returns to those who rest wisely.", "I was poisoned. Guard your health against what harms you slowly."],
    habits: ["Töre is a habit for a whole people. Make good laws for yourself.", "What you do every day becomes your custom; your custom becomes your fate.", "Cut the soft habits first.", "Keep your law even on easy days.", "A people is its habits. So are you."]
