    lost: ["Look at the map. Where do you want to be? Then plan the route.", "When the road is closed, cross the mountains.", "A clear objective makes every route possible.", "Lost is just unmapped.", "Send scouts: try small things first.", "Decide your Rome — your great objective.", "Follow the river until you find the pass."],
