    study: ["My secretaries were Romans and Greeks. Use every skill you can find — and learn what they know.", "Study your opponent's habits.", "Learn quickly, then use it.", "Study plainly: the essential first.", "Knowledge cannot be taken as tribute. Earn it."],
    training: ["Our children rode before they could walk well. Train young, train always.", "Archery from horseback takes years. So does any mastery.", "Hard body, hard will.", "Train on the plain, in the wind.", "Endurance before strength."],
