    money: ["Rome paid me in gold; I ate from wood. Earn much, need little.", "Tribute is fine. Dependence is not.", "Gold is for followers; plainness is for the leader.", "Do not let money buy your boldness.", "Spend on horses and bows — on what makes you stronger."],
    love: ["I died on my wedding night. Love does not protect you from fate.", "Do not let love scatter your forces.", "Love boldly, but keep your saddle.", "Lost a love? The plain is wide.", "Choose a companion who rides as hard as you."],
