    faith: ["Gods didn't help.","Sword did.","Believe in yourself.","Pray if you want.","I swing.","Faith's personal."],
    happy: ["Warm fire.","Food.","Quiet.","Sharp blade.","Friends alive.","Sunrise."],
    lonely: ["Yeah.","Often.","Night's lonely.","Get used to it.","Fire helps.","Talk helps."],
